WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:01.801 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers
This is "Late Night,"

00:00:01.801 --> 00:00:03.236 align:start size:94% position:6%
and we hope you're
doing well tonight.

00:00:03.236 --> 00:00:03.937 size:81% position:41% line:92%
Let's get to the news.

00:00:03.937 --> 00:00:06.940 size:88% position:44%
According to a new book
about the 2020 election,

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:10.143
Trump campaign aides
intentionally gave Rudy Giuliani

00:00:10.143 --> 00:00:13.513 align:start size:94% position:6%
the wrong time
to show up for a debate prep

00:00:13.513 --> 00:00:15.582 align:start size:94% position:6%
though that hardly
seems necessary.

00:00:15.582 --> 00:00:19.619
"Hey, boss, I'm here at the bait
shop. Where are you guys?"

00:00:19.619 --> 00:00:22.155
Amazon founder Jeff Bezos
traveled to space today

00:00:22.155 --> 00:00:25.492
aboard his company Blue Origin's
first manned rocket launch

00:00:25.492 --> 00:00:28.228 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm not sure what they use
to fuel the rocket,

00:00:28.228 --> 00:00:31.865 align:start size:94% position:6%
but based on the design,
I'm going to say

00:00:31.865 --> 00:00:33.767 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
two D batteries?

00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:37.237
President Biden will trave
tomorrow to Cincinnati, Ohio

00:00:37.237 --> 00:00:41.474 align:start size:94% position:6%
which is about as impressive
as what Bezos did today.

00:00:41.474 --> 00:00:43.376 size:88% position:44% line:92%
That wasn't space, dude!

00:00:43.376 --> 00:00:46.713
In a recent interview for
a new book about his presidency,

00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:47.947 line:92%
former President Trump sai

00:00:47.947 --> 00:00:49.849 size:84% position:42%
if George Washington
came back from the dead

00:00:49.849 --> 00:00:52.352 align:start size:94% position:6%
and picked Abraham Lincoln
as his running mate,

00:00:52.352 --> 00:00:54.120 align:start size:94% position:6%
it would be hard
for Washington and Lincoln

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:56.790 align:start size:94% position:6%
to beat him in an election
though I'm not sure

00:00:56.790 --> 00:00:59.559 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I would maybe
have beaten two zombies"

00:00:59.559 --> 00:01:01.861 line:92%
is the flex he thinks it is.

00:01:01.861 --> 00:01:02.662 line:92%
According to the latest numbers,

00:01:02.662 --> 00:01:04.631
coronavirus cases are increasing
in every state.

00:01:04.631 --> 00:01:08.735
But, hey, if I wanted a case
of Corona, it'd be this one.

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:11.004 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's right.
If you're going to insist

00:01:11.004 --> 00:01:14.574 align:start size:94% position:6%
on not getting vaccinated
and prolonging the pandemic,

00:01:14.574 --> 00:01:16.943 align:start size:94% position:6%
we're starting jokes over
from the beginning.

00:01:16.943 --> 00:01:20.780 align:start size:94% position:6%
We're just going to cycle back
to the 2019 punch lines.

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:21.581 line:92%
It'll be like Groundhog Day.

00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:25.552 align:start size:94% position:6%
You won't even be able to tell
if it's a rerun or not.

00:01:25.552 --> 00:01:28.221 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Okay?

00:01:28.221 --> 00:01:29.089 line:92%
According the latest numbers

00:01:29.089 --> 00:01:31.224
coronavirus cases are increasing
in every state.

00:01:31.224 --> 00:01:34.027 align:start size:94% position:6%
Wow. The only thing
more dangerous than COVID

00:01:34.027 --> 00:01:36.930 line:92%
is Carole Baskin. I'm serious.

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:38.865 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:38.865 --> 00:01:40.767 size:81% position:41% line:92%
That was your warning.

00:01:40.767 --> 00:01:42.602 align:start size:94% position:6%
A 20-acre mountain
in Switzerland

00:01:42.602 --> 00:01:46.272 align:start size:94% position:6%
is up for sale on eBay
for $235,000,

00:01:46.272 --> 00:01:50.110 align:start size:94% position:6%
but they really hammer you
on the shipping.

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:52.112 size:78% position:39%
Major League Baseball
has reportedly banned

00:01:52.112 --> 00:01:55.748 align:start size:94% position:6%
a New York Yankees fan for lif
from every MLB ballpark

00:01:55.748 --> 00:01:58.785 align:start size:94% position:6%
after he threw a ball
from the stands on Saturda

00:01:58.785 --> 00:02:00.453 line:92%
at a Boston Red Sox outfielder

00:02:00.453 --> 00:02:03.923 align:start size:94% position:6%
Said the Yankees,
"Does he have a curve ball?"

00:02:03.923 --> 00:02:07.527
Fox News host Sean Hannity tol
viewers on his show last night

00:02:07.527 --> 00:02:09.796 align:start size:94% position:6%
to take the coronavirus
seriously.

00:02:09.796 --> 00:02:11.998 line:92%
July 2021, right on time.

00:02:11.998 --> 00:02:16.002
It's like if today I asked
if anyone's heard of Lizzo

00:02:16.002 --> 00:02:17.070 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Check her out.

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:20.140 align:start size:94% position:6%
A banner plane made
an emergency landing yesterday

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:20.874 line:92%
on a bridge in New Jersey.

00:02:20.874 --> 00:02:25.245 align:start size:94% position:6%
Luckily, bystanders
on the ground were prepared.

00:02:26.579 --> 00:02:29.149 align:start size:94% position:6%
And finally,
today was World Jump Day.

00:02:29.149 --> 00:02:31.050 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you'll probably
still get higher

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:33.153 align:start size:94% position:6%
than Jeff Bezos went this
morning.

00:02:33.153 --> 00:02:35.388 size:88% position:44% line:92%
That wasn't space, dude!

00:02:35.388 --> 00:02:36.756 line:92%
And that was a monologue.

00:02:36.756 --> 00:02:39.893 align:start size:94% position:6%
Scollins coming after
Bezos hard.

